00:35:54.871 --> 00:35:59.100
<i>After we saw the light,
I could feel the baby growing inside me.</i>


00:36:00.143 --> 00:36:02.031
<i>But Jarrod was different.</i>


00:36:02.111 --> 00:36:04.191
